    <string name="onb_2_body">The file is protected forever — no cleaner will ever touch it.</string>
    <string name="onb_2_title">Swipe right to Keep</string>
    <string name="onb_3_body">It joins your cleaning queue. You confirm before anything happens.</string>
    <string name="onb_3_title">Swipe left to Clean</string>
    <string name="onb_4_body">Nothing is ever deleted without your explicit OK — Android itself asks last.\n\nDeleted files rest in the system Trash for ~30 days.\n\nAnd the Keep-safe list outranks every cleaner in the app.</string>
